Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 00:11:26 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Support multiplayer client rendering diagnostics with bound
 RPC targets

Separate local rtx.* configuration from the developer mutation gate, preserving single-player/cheat/insecure restrictions for arbitrary Lua, engine, memory and detour operations. Report native process identity and bind file RPC requests/replies to the selected PID. Refuse ambiguous external targets and add explicit PID/root selection. Native policy and transport/selection tests pass; build the standalone module against the pinned SDK.
